; units/stack.spr: the stack presentation drawn by units/stack.js: the standard (owner field, division
; and sigil), with moves shown by its finial pip and brightness.
; The ui namespace belongs to the ui set: this sprite moves to ui/heraldry.spr verbatim when the ui
; set adopts it (stack.js finds it by name, wherever it is defined; then drop this file's source
