= ui/stack_banner 7x12 0,0
: flag 1,2,5,8
: finial 0,0
: note the stack standard: a slate pole and crossbar with a 5x8 gonfalon (the owner's field and division, the civ sigil centred on it, swallow tails in the shade); the finial pip at 0,0 shows moves and heroes; stack.js draws it in the shade (quiet) except for your own movable or selected stack
